{"id":66682,"date":"2025-08-29T08:24:37","date_gmt":"2025-08-29T07:24:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=66682"},"modified":"2026-10-28T14:12:46","modified_gmt":"2026-10-28T13:12:46","slug":"bonfim-run-porto","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/bonfim-run-porto\/","title":{"rendered":"Bonfim Run Porto 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Bonfim Run Porto 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Bonfim Run Porto 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>15 de novembro de 2026<\/strong>, \u00e0s <strong>10:00<\/strong>, com partida e chegada na freguesia do <strong>Bonfim<\/strong>, na cidade do <strong>Porto<\/strong>. O evento integra oficialmente o circuito <strong>ProEvents Running Series 2026\/2027<\/strong> e \u00e9 promovido pela <strong>ProEvents<\/strong> em parceria com a <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal do Porto<\/strong>, a <strong>Junta de Freguesia do Bonfim<\/strong> e a <strong>Porto. \u00c1gora \u2013 Cultura e Desporto<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo contempla duas provas com partida \u00e0s <strong>10:00<\/strong> e tempo m\u00e1ximo de dura\u00e7\u00e3o de <strong>2 horas<\/strong>: a competitiva <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> (aberta a atletas federados e n\u00e3o federados nos escal\u00f5es Seniores 18-39 anos e Veteranos I a VI, com abastecimento interm\u00e9dio e na meta) e a <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> de car\u00e1ter participativo. A Corrida de 10 km atribui pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios aos tr\u00eas primeiros classificados da Geral Masculina e Feminina (50 \u20ac ao 1\u00ba, 30 \u20ac ao 2\u00ba e 20 \u20ac ao 3\u00ba), bem como trof\u00e9us aos tr\u00eas primeiros de cada escal\u00e3o.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O secretariado oficial para levantamento dos kits e dorsais funciona na <strong>Junta de Freguesia do Bonfim<\/strong> no s\u00e1bado, 14 de novembro de 2026, das 10h00 \u00e0s 18h00, e no domingo, dia da prova, das 08h00 \u00e0s 09h00. Descobre mais provas no guia de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-10km\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de 10 km<\/a> e calcula o teu ritmo na <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box